{
  "_comment": [
    "The SHAPE of Syncthing's four configuration objects: key names and JSON",
    "types, and NOTHING ELSE. No path, no device id, no label \u2014 this file is",
    "checked into a public repository (invariant 13), and every value in a",
    "real config is the owner's.",
    "",
    "It is what `syncthing-options-are-declared` compares",
    "`assets/syncthing-options.nix` against, in BOTH directions: a key",
    "Syncthing added that nothing declares, and a key we declared that",
    "Syncthing does not have, each fail. Without it the table ages in silence.",
    "",
    "TO REFRESH IT, against a Syncthing of the version the flake pins:",
    "  curl -H \"X-API-Key: $key\" http://127.0.0.1:8384/rest/config",
    "and keep only the names and the types."
  ],
